{"version":1,"key":"card:32","content":{"id":32,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"意志力不是由心灵力量控制，而是由大脑控制，在英国有个工人，工人的意志力很好，有一次事故，前额皮质受到了损坏，虽然得以康复，但是性情大变，易怒易躁，这说明是大脑在控制你的意志力。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"意志力会受到哪些因素影响："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"身体极限"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当身体来到极限时，大脑的能量不足，各项功能受到限制，从而使得意志力下降"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"道德许可"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在做出阶段性成果时，我们会允许自己是做一些破坏意志力的事情，比如买买买，吃吃吃，并且觉得这没有什么不对，是自己对自己的一种奖励"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"失控"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在遭受一系列打击后，处于失控状态，此时产生了破罐子破摔的想法，无法节制自己"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"群体效应"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看着别人也在干，自己也跟着做了起来"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何提高意志力："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" 冥想与呼吸"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"冥想：减轻大脑压力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"呼吸：把呼吸频率降低到每分钟 4~6 次，有利于激活大脑前额皮质"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"取消许可"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即使取得了阶段性成果，也要克制自己，不要放纵"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自我同情"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不要自我批评，陷入内疚，这样会降低积极性和意志力，相反，对自我同情，会提高积极性和意志力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"结交朋友"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"近朱者赤近墨者黑，多交志同道合之辈"}]}]}]}],"tags":["心理学"],"createTime":1688953452886,"updateTime":1743303640386,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640386}}